Install plan · minimal-pack 0.1.0 · variant shared · mode isolated
root: /home/u/.dotai/isolated
shared skills: /home/u/.agents/skills · commit-message, linked, review
  note: notes is skipped: it is not a skill, a directory with a SKILL.md
  note: the shared skill commit-message is not linked into claudecode: the pack has a skill of that name, which wins
  note: the shared skill commit-message is not copied into antigravity-cli: the pack has a skill of that name, which wins
  note: the shared skill linked is not copied into antigravity-cli: data/cache in it is not a regular file or a directory, or has a name some OS cannot store
warning: onboarding-hook-skipped: antigravity-cli gets the profiling skill dotai-profiles but not the session-start hook that tells a session when to load it

claudecode · partial isolation · may need a new login
  binary: /usr/bin/claude
  config: /home/u/.claude
  CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=/home/u/.dotai/isolated/claude
  leaks: the CLAUDE.md, .claude/CLAUDE.md and CLAUDE.local.md of each directory above the working directory still load, but for your ~/CLAUDE.md, ~/CLAUDE.local.md, ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md and ~/.claude/rules, which the isolated settings exclude with claudeMdExcludes

